WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.259 --> 00:00:03.509
(mellow hip hop music)

00:00:24.568 --> 00:00:27.317
- [Narrator] In Ghana,
coffins can look like this.

00:00:27.317 --> 00:00:29.057
They're carved into whimsical shapes

00:00:29.057 --> 00:00:30.259
and painted bright colors

00:00:30.259 --> 00:00:34.342
meant to represent a
person's life or occupation.

00:00:53.579 --> 00:00:55.629
- [Narrator] Anang and his
family are at the center

00:00:55.629 --> 00:00:57.331
of these extravagantly designed,

00:00:57.331 --> 00:00:58.999
larger than life coffins

00:00:58.999 --> 00:01:02.499
made in the shape of whatever one desires.

00:01:13.347 --> 00:01:15.329
- [Narrator] It started about 65 years ago

00:01:15.329 --> 00:01:16.929
with an odd request from a chief

00:01:16.929 --> 00:01:20.278
to be buried in a coffin
shaped like a cocoa pod.

00:01:20.278 --> 00:01:22.367
From there, the requests kept coming in

00:01:22.367 --> 00:01:23.926
and Anang's father realized he had

00:01:23.926 --> 00:01:26.593
a serious business on his hands.

00:01:27.525 --> 00:01:29.427
While funerals are a
sad occasion in Ghana,

00:01:29.427 --> 00:01:31.267
many also see them as an opportunity

00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:33.434
to celebrate the deceased.

00:01:44.169 --> 00:01:45.002
- [Narrator] When an order comes in

00:01:45.002 --> 00:01:46.409
for one of their coffins,

00:01:46.409 --> 00:01:49.078
they first get the
measurements of the deceased,

00:01:49.078 --> 00:01:52.158
carve the wood into the shape
of the family's choosing,

00:01:52.158 --> 00:01:56.478
create an opening and
sand it for smoothness.

00:01:56.478 --> 00:01:58.945
It then goes to an artist for painting.

00:01:58.945 --> 00:02:00.329
Once the interior's stuffed,

00:02:00.329 --> 00:02:02.646
it's ready to be delivered to the family.

00:02:02.646 --> 00:02:06.729
And these coffins are not
only delivered locally.

00:02:12.517 --> 00:02:16.684
- [Narrator] As for Anang, he
already has his picked out.

